			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 0,
				"to": 8000
			},
			"text": " Hey everyone, it's Charlie here from Trio SmartCal, and I've got the latest installment in the Co-Rad saga for you."
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:00:08,000",
				"to": "00:00:14,000"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 8000,
				"to": 14000
			},
			"text": " This is the new power supply that they've sent us, and what we're going to do with it is give it a short-circuit test,"
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:00:14,000",
				"to": "00:00:21,000"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 14000,
				"to": 21000
			},
			"text": " we're going to give it an intermittent short-circuit test, we're going to give it a full-load test,"
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:00:21,000",
				"to": "00:00:24,000"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 21000,
				"to": 24000
			},
			"text": " and we're going to give it an intermittent full-load test."
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:00:24,000",
				"to": "00:00:31,000"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 24000,
				"to": 31000
			},
			"text": " And hopefully we'll be able to recreate the conditions that Dave did when he blew its predecessor up."
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:00:31,000",
				"to": "00:00:34,000"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 31000,
				"to": 34000
			},
			"text": " So, let's get on and see how the testing goes."
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:00:34,000",
				"to": "00:00:39,000"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 34000,
				"to": 39000
			},
			"text": " And by the way, I'm going to try and see if I can use it as a bit of an arc welder as well."
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:00:39,000",
				"to": "00:00:42,000"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 39000,
				"to": 42000
			},
			"text": " Okay, well the first test is a short-circuit test."
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:00:42,000",
				"to": "00:00:48,000"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 42000,
				"to": 48000
			},
			"text": " As a short-circuit, I'm using an Agilent U1252A multimeter on the current inputs,"
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:00:48,000",
				"to": "00:00:51,000"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 48000,
				"to": 51000
			},
			"text": " so that's pretty close to being a short-circuit."
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:00:51,000",
				"to": "00:00:54,000"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 51000,
				"to": 54000
			},
			"text": " And we've just got the leads."
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:00:54,000",
				"to": "00:00:59,000"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 54000,
				"to": 59000
			},
			"text": " I'm going to short it out there, so basically we're just feeding it straight into the current terminals of a multimeter."
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:00:59,000",
				"to": "00:01:04,000"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 59000,
				"to": 64000
			},
			"text": " The power supply is set to 1 volt and 5 amps."
